    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it sounds like something people just say to be nice. but it's not true. i really messed up something i can't fix. the guilt is just... it's heavy. like every time i breathe i just feel this weight of knowing i'm a mistake. it's not a \"growth moment,\" it's just who i am now. i'm just fundamentally broken.",
